WEBVTT

00:00:03.375 --> 00:00:04.708
Just look at her.

00:00:07.375 --> 00:00:09.374
Oh, yeah. She plays.

00:00:09.375 --> 00:00:11.167
Oh, yeah? Prove it.

00:00:11.667 --> 00:00:15.083
Okay, Smarty Pants. We will.

00:00:17.083 --> 00:00:19.916
[sniffs, snorting]

00:00:19.917 --> 00:00:21.417
[groans]

00:00:22.042 --> 00:00:23.375
Morning, Jimmy.

00:00:24.542 --> 00:00:27.125
Ready for breakfast? Hmm?

00:00:31.750 --> 00:00:32.583
Whoa.

00:00:33.125 --> 00:00:35.916
Hey, Mom! Where'd you find the cowgirl?

00:00:35.917 --> 00:00:37.000
[chuckles]

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:39.207
<i>I ain't afraid of nothin', partner.</i>

00:00:39.208 --> 00:00:42.374
- [chuckles]
<i>- Yeehaw! Let's play!</i>

00:00:42.375 --> 00:00:43.458
[gasps]

00:00:44.375 --> 00:00:45.625
Yeah.

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:48.791
[chuckles]

00:00:48.792 --> 00:00:50.500
Wait a minute.

00:00:52.958 --> 00:00:54.207
[Blaze chuckles] Hmm.

00:00:54.208 --> 00:00:55.291
Neigh!

00:00:55.292 --> 00:00:56.999
Well, flush me.

00:00:57.000 --> 00:00:59.041
Blaze is actually gonna play.

00:00:59.042 --> 00:01:01.791
[vocalizing] Here we go!

00:01:01.792 --> 00:01:03.708
[♪ ballroom music playing]

00:01:04.542 --> 00:01:05.792
- M'la-- [gasps]
- [gasps, chuckles]

00:01:07.458 --> 00:01:09.708
M'lady Davenport,

00:01:10.750 --> 00:01:13.332
I present Her Royal Highness,

00:01:13.333 --> 00:01:15.499
Jimmy Queen.

00:01:15.500 --> 00:01:16.999
[snorting]

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:20.291
[clears throat]
Your Highness, how kind of you

00:01:20.292 --> 00:01:21.957
to invite me to your royal ball--

00:01:21.958 --> 00:01:24.457
[babbling]

00:01:24.458 --> 00:01:26.749
Jimmy! This is your big moment.

00:01:26.750 --> 00:01:29.167
- [snorting]
- [toys beeping]

00:01:30.458 --> 00:01:32.249
What you got there, Jimmy?

00:01:32.250 --> 00:01:33.666
[snorting]

00:01:33.667 --> 00:01:35.875
Whoa.

00:01:36.708 --> 00:01:38.917
[chuckling] I can't believe
I still have these.

00:01:39.708 --> 00:01:41.625
[gasps] Wait a minute.

00:01:43.042 --> 00:01:46.041
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

00:01:46.042 --> 00:01:47.332
[Snappy] <i>Agent Clydesdale,</i>

00:01:47.333 --> 00:01:49.082
<i>your suitor is approaching now.</i>

00:01:49.083 --> 00:01:50.166
[gasps]

00:01:50.167 --> 00:01:53.332
So, we meet again, Agent Sheet-land.

00:01:53.333 --> 00:01:54.999
It's pronounced Shet-land. "Shet."

00:01:55.000 --> 00:01:56.249
That's what I said.

00:01:56.250 --> 00:01:58.166
Well, Agent Clydesdale, or should I say,

00:01:58.167 --> 00:02:00.499
Lady Davenport, have you spotted it yet?

00:02:00.500 --> 00:02:01.791
You mean, the bomb?

00:02:01.792 --> 00:02:03.207
Yes! Shh! Quiet!

00:02:03.208 --> 00:02:04.749
Snappy, do you have eyes on it?

00:02:04.750 --> 00:02:06.625
Not yet. Atlas, do you copy?

00:02:08.125 --> 00:02:10.291
Agents! The bomb is right on top of you!

00:02:10.292 --> 00:02:12.707
- [beeping]
- [gasps] Where? Where?

00:02:12.708 --> 00:02:13.832
[laughs]

00:02:13.833 --> 00:02:17.457
Where you never suspected,
Agent Clydesdale!

00:02:17.458 --> 00:02:20.167
- [laughing]
- [guests gasping]

00:02:20.875 --> 00:02:23.207
- [gasps]
- [laughs]

00:02:23.208 --> 00:02:25.457
But where is the bomb?

00:02:25.458 --> 00:02:27.708
[beeping]

00:02:31.542 --> 00:02:32.583
[exclaims]

00:02:34.208 --> 00:02:35.582
She's coming to, Buzz.

00:02:35.583 --> 00:02:36.707
[tablet beeping]

00:02:36.708 --> 00:02:37.791
Hurry it up.

00:02:37.792 --> 00:02:39.291
[Buzz] I'm trying, Woody!

00:02:39.292 --> 00:02:41.916
What... What happened?

00:02:41.917 --> 00:02:44.374
Wait. What did you do to my battery?

00:02:44.375 --> 00:02:45.791
What we'll do again if you don't tell us

00:02:45.792 --> 00:02:47.416
what happened to Jessie and Bullseye.

00:02:47.417 --> 00:02:49.291
What time is it? [gasps]

00:02:49.292 --> 00:02:51.207
Oh, no! This is not good.

00:02:51.208 --> 00:02:53.707
The girls got a head start
on Turtle Tag without Bonnie!

00:02:53.708 --> 00:02:55.999
There's been one, two,
three inside jokes already.

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:57.082
This is a disaster!

00:02:57.083 --> 00:02:59.541
Enough with the silly games.
Where's Jessie and Bullseye?

00:02:59.542 --> 00:03:02.416
Silly? This is serious, Stuffalo Bill!

00:03:02.417 --> 00:03:03.832
Bonnie is missing out.

00:03:03.833 --> 00:03:04.916
Stuffalo Bill?

00:03:04.917 --> 00:03:06.916
Want her to make friends? This is how!

00:03:06.917 --> 00:03:09.041
Now keep your little
plastic hands away from me

00:03:09.042 --> 00:03:11.041
or I will set off my alarm.

00:03:11.042 --> 00:03:12.499
I thought you'd say as much.

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:14.832
Buzz, bring in "Sammy Two."

00:03:14.833 --> 00:03:18.000
- No. No. Absolutely not.
- [grunting]

00:03:18.750 --> 00:03:19.957
- Oh, no, no, no--
- [alarm blaring]

00:03:19.958 --> 00:03:21.291
- [Buzz] Yes. [chuckles]
- [alarm stops]

00:03:21.292 --> 00:03:23.332
- Okay, try "settings."
- You mean this?

00:03:23.333 --> 00:03:25.666
- That's a gear symbol.
- Okay, got it. Now what?

00:03:25.667 --> 00:03:26.750
Reduce her screen time to zero.

00:03:27.750 --> 00:03:28.792
[Buzz] The shortest is an hour.

00:03:30.458 --> 00:03:32.041
- What?
- "Horse grill"? Who is that?

00:03:32.042 --> 00:03:33.332
"Horse girl."

00:03:33.333 --> 00:03:35.999
- She's talking about Jessie.
- Well, then open it. [gasps]

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:37.374
- Whoa!
- [grunting]

00:03:37.375 --> 00:03:38.624
[tablet chimes]

00:03:38.625 --> 00:03:41.041
- [Lilypad exclaims]
- [Woody] My hips.

00:03:41.042 --> 00:03:42.749
Enjoy the garage, suckers!

00:03:42.750 --> 00:03:44.124
- No, no, no! Lily!
- Wait. Hey!

00:03:44.125 --> 00:03:45.041
[gasps]

00:03:45.042 --> 00:03:46.375
<i>Yes, can I help you?</i>

00:03:47.125 --> 00:03:48.332
Huh?

00:03:48.333 --> 00:03:50.499
- Wait a minute. [shushes]
- Fascinating.

00:03:50.500 --> 00:03:53.207
Lily, bring back that "horse girl" post.

00:03:53.208 --> 00:03:54.457
[distorted buzzing]

00:03:54.458 --> 00:03:55.582
<i>Okay.</i>

00:03:55.583 --> 00:03:58.749
Oh, she has to do what you say.

00:03:58.750 --> 00:04:00.999
- [screams]
- [gasps, grunts]

00:04:01.000 --> 00:04:02.374
- She's getting away, Buzz!
- Lily!

00:04:02.375 --> 00:04:03.832
- Hey, Lily!
- Hey, stop her!

00:04:03.833 --> 00:04:04.916
- Hey, Lily!
<i>- Yes?</i>

00:04:04.917 --> 00:04:06.708
- Open that post!
<i>- Okay!</i>

00:04:07.708 --> 00:04:08.957
- [gasps] Jessie.
- Bonnie's gotta see this.

00:04:08.958 --> 00:04:10.999
[Buzz] Show her again.
Where is she? Hey, Lily.

00:04:11.000 --> 00:04:11.916
- Hey, Lily!
<i>- Yes?</i>

00:04:11.917 --> 00:04:13.041
- Show the post.
<i>- Can I help you?</i>

00:04:13.042 --> 00:04:13.957
- Share it everywhere!
- Share!

00:04:13.958 --> 00:04:14.916
SEND ALL
SENT

00:04:14.917 --> 00:04:15.832
<i>- Yes!</i>
- Share!

00:04:15.833 --> 00:04:16.916
We did it!

00:04:16.917 --> 00:04:17.999
So, where did it go?

00:04:18.000 --> 00:04:19.124
Lily...

00:04:19.125 --> 00:04:21.042
[all grunting]

00:04:22.250 --> 00:04:23.249
[Lilypad panting]

00:04:23.250 --> 00:04:24.625
- [machine whirring]
- [gasps]

00:04:25.792 --> 00:04:27.791
- [Buzz] The printer! Yes!
- [Woody laughs]

00:04:27.792 --> 00:04:28.707
[Bonnie] Okay, I'm done.

00:04:28.708 --> 00:04:30.082
[Mom] Bonnie, you haven't
finished your breakfast.

00:04:30.083 --> 00:04:31.917
- [Bonnie] No, I'm done.
- [gasps]

00:04:33.458 --> 00:04:36.291
I'm missing Turtle Tag, Mom.
They're playing without me.

00:04:36.292 --> 00:04:38.874
- [groans, pants]
- [Lilypad laughs]

00:04:38.875 --> 00:04:40.124
Now what, Deputy?

00:04:40.125 --> 00:04:42.042
Well, you're the deputy, Deputy.

00:04:44.542 --> 00:04:46.208
What's this all about, Bonnie?

00:04:48.125 --> 00:04:50.042
- Huh?
- [groans]

00:04:53.167 --> 00:04:55.166
So, why did you put her toys
in the garage?

00:04:55.167 --> 00:04:57.207
Uh, because Bonnie asked me to.

00:04:57.208 --> 00:04:59.291
- Remember, sweetie?
- No.

00:04:59.292 --> 00:05:01.207
[Dad] Well, I don't think
Lilypad texted me.

00:05:01.208 --> 00:05:04.666
They're gone. She really does
have Jessie and Bullseye.

00:05:04.667 --> 00:05:06.374
I hope they're okay.

00:05:06.375 --> 00:05:08.082
Okay, we've gotten the queen to safety.

00:05:08.083 --> 00:05:10.791
Yes. You can do this, Agent Clydesdale.

00:05:10.792 --> 00:05:12.457
One of these buttons defuses the bomb.

00:05:12.458 --> 00:05:14.457
But which one, Agent "Sheetland"?

00:05:14.458 --> 00:05:16.624
"Shet"! [sobbing] It's "Shet"!

00:05:16.625 --> 00:05:18.583
[beeping]

00:05:19.167 --> 00:05:20.167
[beeping stops]

00:05:21.833 --> 00:05:23.791
Boom! [imitates explosion]

00:05:23.792 --> 00:05:26.957
Oh, no! [imitates explosion] [screams]

00:05:26.958 --> 00:05:29.624
[Blaze's mom] Blaze! Hon!
It's time to feed Daffodil.

00:05:29.625 --> 00:05:31.707
[kisses] Okay! [chuckles]

00:05:31.708 --> 00:05:33.667
Come on, Your Majesty.

00:05:34.667 --> 00:05:35.957
[Blaze's mom] Thanks, babe!

00:05:35.958 --> 00:05:37.041
[door closes]

00:05:37.042 --> 00:05:37.957
[Snappy laughs]

00:05:37.958 --> 00:05:40.416
- Holy cow! Wow!
- That was so cool! [squeals]

00:05:40.417 --> 00:05:42.791
- I was a spy! What?
- Yeah, you were!

00:05:42.792 --> 00:05:44.082
- You were the best spy!
- Wow.

00:05:44.083 --> 00:05:45.707
[both chuckling]

00:05:45.708 --> 00:05:47.874
- Smarty?
- [sobbing]

00:05:47.875 --> 00:05:50.083
That was so beautiful.

00:05:50.625 --> 00:05:53.374
That, my friend, was playin'.

00:05:53.375 --> 00:05:55.916
- Oh, boy, did we.
- I feel so alive!

00:05:55.917 --> 00:05:57.916
Is that what being a toy is like, Sheriff?

00:05:57.917 --> 00:05:59.957
Well, yeah, it's... Wait, hold up.

00:05:59.958 --> 00:06:02.749
You never called me
sheriff before in a nice way.

00:06:02.750 --> 00:06:03.957
But, well, now I get it.

00:06:03.958 --> 00:06:06.416
Blaze really is perfect for Bonnie.

00:06:06.417 --> 00:06:08.666
Playing with her feels just the same.

00:06:08.667 --> 00:06:11.166
- Your kid plays like that too?
- [chimes]

00:06:11.167 --> 00:06:12.250
[all gasp]

00:06:13.000 --> 00:06:13.999
DO YOU REALLY HAVE MY TOYS?

00:06:14.000 --> 00:06:15.124
- [Jessie gasps]
- [gasps] It's her!

00:06:15.125 --> 00:06:16.874
She saw the post! It's Bonnie!

00:06:16.875 --> 00:06:18.374
- Go on! Do it.
- Text her back.

00:06:18.375 --> 00:06:19.916
- Go on.
- Text her back.

00:06:19.917 --> 00:06:22.707
[all chanting]
Text her back! Text her back.

00:06:22.708 --> 00:06:25.167
Okay, okay, how do I do that?

00:06:25.833 --> 00:06:27.916
[tablet beeping]

00:06:27.917 --> 00:06:29.457
do you really have my toys?

00:06:29.458 --> 00:06:30.874
yes

00:06:30.875 --> 00:06:32.750
do u still want them?

00:06:34.625 --> 00:06:36.667
[beeping]

00:06:39.833 --> 00:06:40.874
YES.

00:06:40.875 --> 00:06:42.082
- [sighs]
- What? Oh, yes!

00:06:42.083 --> 00:06:43.707
MY MOM WANTS UR ADDRESS

00:06:43.708 --> 00:06:44.832
WE WILL COME GET THEM

00:06:44.833 --> 00:06:45.916
- All right!
- She's coming.

00:06:45.917 --> 00:06:48.249
- Bonnie's coming here.
- [Snappy] I knew she would.

00:06:48.250 --> 00:06:50.499
Blaze and Bonnie are gonna meet.

00:06:50.500 --> 00:06:52.457
- [beeping]
- Smarty, what are you typing?

00:06:52.458 --> 00:06:53.707
BRING $$$

00:06:53.708 --> 00:06:54.791
- Delete that right now.
- What?

00:06:54.792 --> 00:06:56.708
I'm just trying to get some
batteries out of the deal.

00:06:58.083 --> 00:06:59.332
So, what's going on?

00:06:59.333 --> 00:07:00.458
Slink, talk to me.

00:07:00.958 --> 00:07:02.791
Hard to hear. A lot of commotion.

00:07:02.792 --> 00:07:04.582
I bet they're arguing over
getting rid of us.

00:07:04.583 --> 00:07:06.541
[exclaims] Are we getting donated?

00:07:06.542 --> 00:07:09.707
- Mmm. Doughnuts.
- No, sweetie. Donated.

00:07:09.708 --> 00:07:11.832
Wow. I love her,
but this is gonna be hard.

00:07:11.833 --> 00:07:14.957
Shh! Quiet! I hear something.
Like tiny footsteps.

00:07:14.958 --> 00:07:16.874
- Aw. Kind of cute.
- [footsteps approaching]

00:07:16.875 --> 00:07:18.166
[shouting]

00:07:18.167 --> 00:07:19.833
- Look out!
- Bonnie's coming!

00:07:22.542 --> 00:07:23.582
Come on, Mom.

00:07:23.583 --> 00:07:25.457
[Woody] Oh, no, Lily's going too.

00:07:25.458 --> 00:07:26.832
[Bonnie's mom] Hold on,
Bonnie. I'm sure your toys

00:07:26.833 --> 00:07:27.957
aren't going to run off on their own.

00:07:27.958 --> 00:07:29.124
All right, Buzz, you've gotta stay here.

00:07:29.125 --> 00:07:30.874
- I'm going with them.
- Why? Why just you?

00:07:30.875 --> 00:07:32.541
Look, I just have more
field experience than you.

00:07:32.542 --> 00:07:33.583
That is all.

00:07:34.375 --> 00:07:35.832
You don't think I can do it.

00:07:35.833 --> 00:07:37.916
No, I just think I can do it a little bit...

00:07:37.917 --> 00:07:40.166
- [car engine starts]
- ...better.

00:07:40.167 --> 00:07:42.374
[gasps] You don't deserve this.

00:07:42.375 --> 00:07:44.582
- Buzz, come on. I was only--
- Jessie put me in charge.

00:07:44.583 --> 00:07:46.832
Which is why you should
stay here and watch the room.

00:07:46.833 --> 00:07:48.666
There is no room without Jessie.

00:07:48.667 --> 00:07:50.582
Buzz, no! [groans]

00:07:50.583 --> 00:07:53.166
[♪ dramatic music playing]

00:07:53.167 --> 00:07:55.458
[panting, grunting]

00:07:56.500 --> 00:07:58.957
[breathing heavily]

00:07:58.958 --> 00:07:59.957
[grunts]

00:07:59.958 --> 00:08:02.374
Nice poncho. [scoffs]

00:08:02.375 --> 00:08:04.416
It's good to see them fighting again.

00:08:04.417 --> 00:08:05.667
[Slinky Dog] It sure is.

